import ../../helpers/driver.dl

document focus laboratory:
    text field "Before" containing "first" using no UI appearance
    view group "Options" using no UI appearance:
        paragraph "Closed" containing "Closed" using no UI appearance
        text field "Query" containing "find" using no UI appearance
    text field "After" containing "last" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of focus laboratory
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 600 by 400 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set before to the UI layout labeled "Before" in (view's layout)
set query to the UI layout labeled "Query" in (view's layout)
set after to the UI layout labeled "After" in (view's layout)
activate UI layout before in (the address of view)
set (the UI value for (the control labeled "Options" in window) in window)'s number to 1
activate UI layout query in (the address of view)
require condition ((view's focused = query) and (view's text focus = query's node)) reporting "A newly shown control used its stale hidden focus order."
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's active) reporting "A focused field did not activate native input."
forget UI text source (the address of (query's text source)) in (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's active = false) reporting "Forgetting an active field retained its platform input context."
set (the UI value for (the control labeled "Options" in window) in window)'s number to 0
activate UI layout after in (the address of view)
require condition ((view's focused = after) and (view's text focus = after's node)) reporting "Hiding a preceding control focused a different identity."
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
forget UI text source (the address of (query's text source)) in (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's active) reporting "Forgetting another field retired the current input context."
close the address of view
close window
print line "Programmatic activation refreshes focus identity before using a changed control order."
